From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lewis Gibson <12851394+lewisgibson@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 22:29:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Enable /team with thread safe scoreboard teams

/team was disabled in the base patch. Run it on the global region and make the teams safe to read from the other regions.

